          ],
          "detail": "Han Lei paid the 2,400 yuan fee by mobile payment, gave his name and ID number and registered a fingerprint; the card is valid to 9 February 2031. The agreement then said: \"A member enters by showing the membership card and verifying a fingerprint\"",
