          "label": "The club's fingerprint gate is switched off",
          "summary": "The agreed check is cancelled",
          "groupId": "g-3",
          "actorIds": [],
          "detail": "The Example Fitness Club's fingerprint gate was switched off and the agreed way of checking entry was in fact cancelled. This is a change in equipment and involves no particular party",
